// REFERENCE ONLY — do not deploy from this app.
//
// The analytics namespace lives in the FinERP UAT Firestore database
// (finny-erp-uat), whose rules are owned and deployed by KARANARJUNKSKPVTLTD
// (that project is the ERP app's "uat" alias — see its .firebaserc). This file
// is a copy of the block that was added to
// ../KARANARJUNKSKPVTLTD/firestore.rules so reviewers can see it alongside the
// app.
//
// To change these rules, edit ../KARANARJUNKSKPVTLTD/firestore.rules and deploy
// from THERE (never `firebase deploy` the whole project from this app — this
// app's firebase.json intentionally declares hosting only).

match /analytics/{document=**} {
  // isSuperAdmin() is defined in the shared rules (master-tenant admin/analyst,
  // or the superadmin@fiinny.com platform account).
  allow read, write: if request.auth != null && isSuperAdmin();
}
